<style>
.elp07{--gold:#c9a24a;background:#0d0d0d;color:#f4f2ec;padding:100px 0;
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif}
.elp07 .wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.elp07 .head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;margin-bottom:50px}
.elp07 .head .num{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:15px;color:var(--gold)}
.elp07 h2{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,42px);font-weight:400;
  color:#fff;margin:0}
.elp07 .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}
.elp07 .feature{position:relative}
.elp07 .feature .mark{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:90px;color:var(--gold);opacity:.35;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}
.elp07 .feature p{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2.4vw,28px);line-height:1.45;
  color:#f0eee6;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:520px}
.elp07 .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.elp07 .av{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);color:#0d0d0d;display:flex;
  align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,serif}
.elp07 .who b{font-size:13.5px;display:block;color:#fff}
.elp07 .who span{font-size:11.5px;color:#8b887f}
.elp07 .side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px}
.elp07 .side .card{border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;padding-top:20px}
.elp07 .side .stars{color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:10px}
.elp07 .side p{font-size:13.5px;color:#c9c5bb;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 14px}
.elp07 .side .who b{font-size:13px}
.elp07 .stats{display:flex;gap:0;margin-top:64px;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a}
.elp07 .stats div{flex:1;padding:24px 10px 0;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid #2a2a2a}
.elp07 .stats div:last-child{border-right:none}
.elp07 .stats .n{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:32px;color:var(--gold);line-height:1}
.elp07 .stats .l{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8b887f;margin-top:6px}
@media(max-width:860px){.elp07 .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.elp07 .stats{flex-wrap:wrap}
  .elp07 .stats div{flex:1 1 50%;border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a2a;padding-bottom:16px}}
</style>
<section class="elp07">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="num">(04)</span><h2>Was unsere Kundinnen sagen</h2></div>
    <div class="layout">
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="mark">"</div>
        <p>Mein Kleeblatt-Armband trage ich mittlerweile jeden Tag — die Verarbeitung ist erstaunlich fein, es sieht viel hochwertiger aus, als der Preis vermuten lässt.</p>
        <div class="who"><div class="av">L</div><div><b>Lea M.</b><span>Zürich · Verifizierter Kauf</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="side">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>„Der Ring Ariel ist wunderschön und wirklich verstellbar — passt perfekt. Kam gut verpackt an, genau wie auf den Bildern."</p>
          <div class="who"><div><b>Sara B.</b><span style="color:#8b887f;font-size:11.5px">Bern</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>„Habe mehrere Armbänder zum Stapeln bestellt — tolle Qualität für den Preis, wunderschönes Design."</p>
          <div class="who"><div><b>Nadia K.</b><span style="color:#8b887f;font-size:11.5px">Luzern</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div><div class="n">4.9★</div><div class="l">Durchschnitt</div></div>
      <div><div class="n">1.200+</div><div class="l">Kundinnen</div></div>
      <div><div class="n">100%</div><div class="l">Handgefertigt</div></div>
      <div><div class="n">14 Tage</div><div class="l">Rückgaberecht</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
